---
import Layout from '@layouts/Page.astro';
import LinkList from '@components/LinkList.astro';
import YouTube from '@components/YouTube.astro';
import { musicConcerts } from '@links/registry';
---
<Layout title="Laufey 2025">
  <LinkList slot="sidebar" items={musicConcerts} orientation="vertical" />
<p>
This was my second time seeing Laufey. This time I went with my father and my mentor, Imani Camera. My
father bought the VIP tickets for the Oakland Oco Arena because they were cheaper than the normal tickets at
the San Francisco Oracle Arena. 
</p>
<figure class="photo">
    <img
      src="/images/concerts/laufey_2025/Imani_and_I_at_Laufey.jpg"
      alt="Imani and I at the VIP section of Laufey"
      width="1600"
      height="1067"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption>Imani and I at the VIP section of concert before entering</figcaption>
  </figure>

<p>
Overall the entire concert was amazing. I was right up against the barricade and got to fully experiene the
concert and got within a few feet of her. She performed my favorite song, Too Little, Too Late.
</p>
<YouTube
  id="f8mPby1U69I"
  title="Too Little, Too Late"
  caption="The performance of Too Little, Too Late"
  t="24:58"
/>

<p>
My favorite part of the concert was Snow White where she brought out multiple full body mirrors and they
danced around you could see different vantage points of her.
</p>
<YouTube
  id="f8mPby1U69I"
  title="Snow White"
  caption="The performance of Snow White where she brought out these amazing mirrors"
  t="88:50"
/>

<p>
The crowd was very intense. People were crying and screaming. I was taking in the whole environment
</p>

<figure class="photo">
    <img
      src="/images/concerts/laufey_2025/laufey_stage_2025.jpg"
      alt="Laufey on stage at the Oco Arena"
      width="1600"
      height="1067"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption>Laufey on stage at the Oco Arena in Oakland</figcaption>
  </figure>

</Layout>
